      "description": "The perceived temporal movement or cadence of the emotional event",
      "x_constraints": "Canonical: still, sudden, rising, fading, recurring, spiraling, dragging, suspended, looping, cyclic. looping and cyclic are deprecated (code to recurring). Free text accepted.",
